{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅れたけど、\nねねちゃんとまとちゃんさゆにゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃんは今日見たら一段とちっちゃくなってたwww\nってゆう夢を見た...笑笑\nねねちゃんはね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛くて色っぽくってステキなんだ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてとまたんとはあいかわらずのラブラブで......今日も沢山お話をしたよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも優しくしてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんはメイクさんが言ってたけど、声が小さすぎてドライヤー中もいったん止めなきゃ聞き取れないって言ってたよwww\nいつでも可愛いさゆにゃんなんです♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなメンバーが大好きなんじゃ〜っ（広島弁だよ♪）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ポスターにサイン書き中のアミアミ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段はこんな風におそってきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギャーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"激怖ですよーまったくぅ.........爆笑\n本当にいつも楽しいアミアミ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントにテスト頑張れ!!\nって沢山応援してくれてありがとうございました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆の応援はどうしてこんなにパワーが出るんだろう!?って思うくらい体からパワーが出てきます!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々パワーが足りなくなってきたら、コメントを読み返したり、メンバーとお喋りして充電します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやも、もっともっと元気を届けられるように頑張ります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は朝から大掃除をしたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんは掃除したぁ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/12/16/3023838/0013.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}